# dp/dPsi [Pa per unit normalised flux]
#
# Converted from A_testtokamak_classic_shaped.npz, a 257 x 257
# freegs4e free-boundary solve.
# psi_axis = 8.271712597e-02, psi_surface = 3.492866338e-02,
# the psi_n = 0.95 surface, chosen to avoid the X-point corner
# and the fractional power at the plasma edge.
# BOTH abscissae are normalised flux and they run OPPOSITE WAYS:
# freegs4e's psi_n is 0 on the axis and 1 on the separatrix, and
# MEQ's Psi is 1 on the axis and 0 on Gamma, so
# Psi = 1 - psi_n/0.95.
# freegs4e's pprime/ffprime are d/dpsi -- its docstring says
# d/dpsi_n and is wrong -- so the value column carries ONE factor
# of dpsi/dPsi = psi_ax and nothing else. Do not pre-divide by
# psi_ax: meq::NormalisedMHDSource does that itself.
#
# Three columns: Psi, value, d(value)/dPsi, ascending in Psi and
# reaching 0 and 1 EXACTLY -- so meq::SplineProfile interpolates
# everywhere the solve can reach and its clamp never fires.
#
